contentText:
Lizzo is ready to go to court, if the day ever comes. Amid her ongoing legal battle with her former backup dancers &#8212; who in 2023 filed a lawsuit alleging sexual harassment and toxic workplace conditions, which she vehemently denies &#8212; the singer explained in an interview with Gayle King why she refuses to settle the case.

